{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id25638147"}, "name":{"label":"EmmyWithin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-29T22:07:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"14011603755"}, "title":{"label":"Can’t sleep or read without it"}, "content":{"label":"I initially doubted Endel, but now I can’t sleep without it. While the built-in white noise on HomePod is effective, Endel’s sleep mode tones instantly make me drowsy after a few weeks of use. It even calms my dog.\n\nAs an AuDHD person, I struggle with reading due to distractions. Endel’s focus, dynamic focus, study, and deeper focus modes help me stay on task and make reading easier.\n\nThe app offers more features, but these are my two favorites.\n\nMy only complaint is that the uplift feature doesn’t collect my health and location data despite the required permissions.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id336307879"}, "name":{"label":"rrd612"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-29T18:47:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"14011184199"}, "title":{"label":"Scam, taking advantage of people with ADHD"}, "content":{"label":"For an app marketed to people with ADHD it is incredibly manipulative to not have clear information about how to cancel the app and no notifications prior to charging over $100 for a year subscription. I tried to seek a refund and was denied. I do not want this app and I would like a refund", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
