{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id744206132"}, "name":{"label":"Gaelitude"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-28T08:49:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"14006225121"}, "title":{"label":"ADHD regulator!"}, "content":{"label":"This app is really helpful for resetting or focusing my nervous system. I primarily use the focus timer- great for work tasks- and the 8D audio - great for regulation. My one qualm is that the 8D audio seems super limited. I think it’s just playing the one track? Surely there can be so much more variety. It’s my understanding they build the focus timer music with ai to building variations that keep your brain engaged. I wish there were more moods /options ir just differences among the 8D offering.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37702192"}, "name":{"label":"showbiz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-28T08:42:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.43"}, "id":{"label":"14006203902"}, "title":{"label":"Latest Mac release is a catchup, not a well designed product"}, "content":{"label":"Endel is a “no brainer” when it comes to finding an ambient soundtrack to accompany your areas of focus in life, however the latest Mac release falls short in design and usability. This latest version feels merely like an attempt at catching up to the iOS versions feature set, while sacrificing usability and adding lots of annoyances.\n\nThe app used to seamlessly mix and flow between sound sets as you adjusted the mood to your liking. Now the sound just abruptly stops before advancing, making the app feel more like an audio player and not something well crafted.\n\nIt is not as fast and responsive as it used to be, and takes a while to load up the main features. It should really be more snappy, and the controls and main features should be within the first 1-2 clicks of opening the app.\n\nI’m not sure if this is a poorly executed Electron app translation of what used to feel more Mac native. I hope the developers can make the app more of a first-class experience that we strive for on the Mac.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
