{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id179496299"}, "name":{"label":"Elwa7sh19"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-11T00:58:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.7.10"}, "id":{"label":"13945616887"}, "title":{"label":"Beware of “trial period”"}, "content":{"label":"Tried downloading to test it out due to good reviews, and saw reference to free trial period but it then directly charged my credit card for 3 months (no free trial). Kinda scammy… beware!  Only gave two stars for nice interface but kinda useless if you have Apple Music or Spotify. I got a refund but they made it difficult and had to go through Apple to cancel & refund. Avoid!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
