{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id380084516"}, "name":{"label":"GenieceT"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-06T11:39:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.7.10"}, "id":{"label":"13929633360"}, "title":{"label":"A Saving Grace"}, "content":{"label":"I normally don’t write reviews on anything, but I had to for this app. Over the last month or so I’ve been at such a low point mentally and looking for relief wherever I could possibly find it. From going to bed after 4AM and only sleeping for 4hrs to waking up with intense headaches because so much stress built up in me that I couldn’t even relax while sleeping. I came across this app while endlessly scrolling social media to keep from having to work on schoolwork (I’m a FT college student) and at the time I had been looking into whether or not my dip in mental productivity was potentially due to ADHD. I decided to give this app a try and my first night’s sleep using the app was the most peaceful sleep I’ve had. No headache, 7hrs of sleeping and woke up feeling refreshed like a new person. I’m shocked at my experience after just one day, but if you’re searching for something to help with your mental slump this app is a God send! I highly recommend trying it out for yourself, hopefully you’ll have a great experience like I did, and I hope it’ll bring you better mental clarity and peace. Best wishes to you all out there!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
